SELECTION-SCREEN END OF BLOCK UPLOAD_SO.

SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF BLOCK UPLOAD_CUST WITH FRAME TITLE TEXT-003.
PARAMETERS : RB_BG RADIOBUTTON GROUP R1 MODIF ID CUS,
             RB_SO RADIOBUTTON GROUP R1 MODIF ID CUS,
             RB_PR RADIOBUTTON GROUP R1 MODIF ID CUS,
             RB_PO RADIOBUTTON GROUP R1 MODIF ID CUS.
SELECTION-SCREEN END OF BLOCK UPLOAD_CUST.

SELECTION-SCREEN BEGIN OF BLOCK UPLOAD_INP WITH FRAME TITLE TEXT-003.
PARAMETERS : RB_BG2 RADIOBUTTON GROUP R2 MODIF ID INP,
